<a name="details" id="details"></a><h2 id="header-details" class="groupheader">Detailed Description</h2>
<div class="textblock"><p>Punto de entrada principal para la aplicación de red. Inicializa y gestiona el ciclo de vida de la red y los sistemas principales. </p>
<p>This is the application's entry point, where the configuration is read and the application is initialized accordingly. This also keeps references to systems that must persist throughout the application's lifecycle. </p>
</div><a name="doc-func-members" id="doc-func-members"></a><h2 id="header-doc-func-members" class="groupheader">Member Function Documentation</h2>
